abstract: Analytical code accompanying the named retrospective cohort study. The full descriptive cohort
  includes 53 children; the IMC analytical population includes 51 after exclusion of two deaths within
  24 hours of admission. No participant-level data are included. See the validation report for reconstruction
  provenance and limitations.
